<p class="event-desc">
  During Utah State University's inaugural International Heroes Night, hosted by the Office of Global Engagement and the International Student Council (ISC), KAABiL Lab's Principal Investigator, Dr. Rakesh Kaundal, was honored with the 2021 International Faculty Recognition Award. Selected for his high intellectual merit, broader research impact, and dedication, Dr. Kaundal was recognized as an exemplary role model for both domestic and international students. Having come to the U.S. as an international student himself, Dr. Kaundal spoke at the event about the vital role of diversity and inclusion in academia, noting that bringing multiple cultures into the university environment fosters critical thinking, problem-solving, and a more holistic understanding of real-world challenges.
</p>

